{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>OpenAI 宣佈，ChatGPT 現已支援 iCloud 郵件與行事曆外掛，用戶可以像連接 Gmail 及其他服務一樣，把 Apple 的電郵與行事曆接入 ChatGPT。對 iCloud 郵件與行事曆用戶而言，這有望首次接通 ChatGPT 的主動代理 Dots 等功能。</p>\n<h2>可搜尋郵件並更新行事曆</h2>\n<p>按 OpenAI 公佈的用法，用戶可要求 ChatGPT 找出指定電郵、整理收件匣、查看接下來有哪些安排，或更新行事曆上的活動。OpenAI 形容這是用戶長期要求的整合。外掛適用於所有 ChatGPT 方案，覆蓋網頁、桌面及 iOS 三個平台。</p>\n<h2>Dots 等功能的覆蓋範圍待測試</h2>\n<p>支援範圍仍存在不確定性。ChatGPT 各項功能在推出初期未必如預期般互相配合，因此需要實際測試，才能確定這次整合在 Dots、Work 及 Codex 等功能上可延伸至多大程度；實際可用範圍有待確認。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 ChatGPT 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"634\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/chatgpt-1.webp\" width=\"1131\"/></figure>\n<figure>\n<blockquote><p>Much requested, and now yours to connect: iCloud Mail and Calendar plugins are available in ChatGPT.<br/><br/>Ask ChatGPT to find that email, catch up on your inbox, check what’s next, or update a calendar event. Phew.<br/><br/>Available on all ChatGPT plans on web, desktop, and iOS. <a href=\"https://t.co/g68OWoFVg8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pic.twitter.com/g68OWoFVg8</a></p>— ChatGPT (@ChatGPT) <a href=\"https://x.com/ChatGPT/status/2115139248458191070?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">October 27, 2026</a></blockquote>\n</figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T18:41:13.044956+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":724,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T18:32:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T02:39:03.724695+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T18:38:23.997248+00:00","content_hash":"0f90e35279dda7954a90f361fba4e10314302a17e655d19804b9352f6e88b39d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}